        <mxCell id="devhost-16" parent="devhostV1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;fontStyle=2;" value="&lt;b&gt;V1&lt;/b&gt; · Nothing but SSH is reachable, and only from the developer&amp;#x27;s IP. The browser on the developer&amp;#x27;s PC reaches the app through the same encrypted SSH connection VS Code uses. Git on the VM reaches GitHub with the developer&amp;#x27;s own key, lent through agent forwarding, so no GitHub key is stored on the VM." vertex="1">
