              <mxPoint x="1750" y="830" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="devhost-31" parent="devhostV2" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;fontStyle=2;" value="&lt;b&gt;V2&lt;/b&gt; · A Test environment runs beside the dev stack: its own clone and Compose project, and a built UI served as plain files instead of dev servers, so it stays light. Anyone with write access picks the branch it runs with a GitHub workflow; a timer rebuilds it when that branch has a new commit. Reviewers reach it, never the dev stack, at one HTTPS address on our own domain served by Cloudflare. The VM opens no web port: cloudflared connects out to Cloudflare, and requests come back through that tunnel. oauth2-proxy lets only GitHub users on the list through. Nobody develops in it." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="1740" x="40" y="1000" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
