        <mxCell id="devhost-57" parent="devhostV3" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;fontStyle=2;" value="&lt;b&gt;V3&lt;/b&gt; · A public demo of main for people outside the project, kept apart from the Test environment. Planned: who may use it, and how its AI credits are protected, are still to be designed." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="1740" x="40" y="1060" as="geometry" />
